{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/skills/omem-task-planning/SKILL.md",
    "title": "受限任务规划技能",
    "summary": "该技能把规划步骤约束为证据关联、可产出、可验证且具有停止条件的建议，并明确任何外部变更都需独立执行者和授权；这是规划规范而非执行能力。",
    "category": "workflow",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "structure",
        "title": "计划分解与步骤要求",
        "body": "技能要求先区分目标、已验证现状、前置条件、依赖、阻塞和未知项，再从五种允许动作中选择步骤。[[c1]] 每一步必须关联输入证据，写明预期制品、验证方法、是否需要所有者批准以及停止条件，形成从依据到验收的最小闭环。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "safety",
        "title": "时间、不确定性与授权边界",
        "body": "未知工作不能标为完成，期限不能凭空编造，并应保留时区和来源措辞。[[c3]] 外部消息、代码修改、部署和数据变化只能作为提案，后续必须由独立执行者在获得授权后处理。技能最终只允许返回 PlanProposal.v1 JSON，不执行提议动作，也不扩大任务范围。[[c4]] 因而它适合生成安全计划，但不能证明任何计划已落地。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "规划状态分类与动作集合",
        "reason": "支持先区分任务状态要素并仅选择五类动作的说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/skills/omem-task-planning/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 6,
          "endLine": 9
        },
        "quote": "# Plan bounded next steps\n\n1. Separate the goal, verified current state, prerequisites, dependencies, blockers, and unknowns.\n2. Propose only `gather_context`, `draft_document`, `break_down_task`, `suggest_reminder`, or `request_decision` actions."
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "步骤证据与验收闭环",
        "reason": "支持每步必须提供证据、产物、验证、批准要求和停止条件。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/skills/omem-task-planning/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 10,
          "endLine": 10
        },
        "quote": "3. For each step, cite input evidence, state the expected artifact, define verification, say whether owner approval is required, and give a stop condition."
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "未知项与时间表述规则",
        "reason": "支持不得提前标记完成、不得编造期限并保留来源时间信息。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/skills/omem-task-planning/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 11,
          "endLine": 11
        },
        "quote": "4. Do not mark unknown work complete. Do not invent deadlines; preserve timezones and source wording."
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "外部执行和授权边界",
        "reason": "支持外部变更需独立执行者与授权，以及技能仅返回 JSON、不执行动作的说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/planner/1/skills/omem-task-planning/SKILL.md",
          "startLine": 12,
          "endLine": 13
        },
        "quote": "5. External messages, code changes, deployments, and data changes remain proposals requiring a separate executor and authorization.\n6. Return PlanProposal.v1 JSON only. Never perform a proposed action or broaden scope."
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "“保留时区和来源措辞”在 PlanProposal.v1 中落入哪个字段，是否有自动检查？",
        "why": "技能提出该要求，但已给材料中的步骤字段没有专门的时间或来源措辞字段，可能只能依赖自由文本承载。",
        "nextStep": "核对输入与输出合同的时间元数据设计，并增加时区和原文保真测试，或明确该信息应写入的字段。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c2",
          "c3"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
